      "writtenOn": "2022-10-06T14:39:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is a flag tracking whether the last allocation was made on behalf of a reserve call from the user (in which case we don\u0027t shrink on element removal).  fUnused does not seem like a good name, maybe fUserReserved or something?",
