      "writtenOn": "2022-10-05T21:18:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The only reason it and everything is duplicated is due to the `this-\u003emove(newItemArray);` line. The `doRealloc` in the cpp here is a kind of manual specialization of this `MEM_MOVE` is true. It would probably be best to just template `doRealloc` on a bool and then instantiate both in the cpp file.",
